   (ASSRIC), Bandung, INDONESIA, MAY 05-06, 2017},
Organization = {IPN Educ Grp},
Abstract = {This study was carried out to investigate whether the strategy STAD
   cooperative learning model can improve student SMK Kuala Kubu Bharu,
   Selangor. Experimental studies have been carried out for a month. The
   sample consisted of 50 male students who took the course design Hidip
   skills. The sample is divided into two groups. 25 students control group
   consisted of students from Form J Bios. While another 25 student's
   experimental group consisting of Form 3 Cimos. Experimental group was
   treated on STAD model cooperative approach, while the control group was
   not given any treatment contrary to the process of teaching as usual
   from their teachers. The instrument was used in this study is a set of
   questionnaire and question experiment PT3 2015. The questionnaire is
   divided into two parts, part A is to gel the background information of
   the respondents. Part B contains those items that are of relevance to
   the research questions. Data were analyzed using SPSS 20.0 the
   Statistical Package for the Social Science Version 20.0 to obtain mean,
   frequency, percentage and standard deviation. The pilot study was
   conducted to see the reliability and suitability questionnaire. The
   findings showed that the overall mean for the level of student
   motivation is 3:10, the level of participation and interaction between
   students is 3.19 a level of perception of the 3.14 level of performance
   of students is 3:30. On the whole, it was found that the level of
   student achievement is the most dominant factor in the practice of
   cooperative learning among students in Form 3 Kubu Bharu Selangor. The
   findings indicate the level of student achievement are at a high level.
   In conclusion, this study demonstrated that cooperative learning model
   STAD has managed to improve the performance of students through course
   work and a written test, in the course of designing the program at a
   secondary school.},
