   (ICEEP 2013), Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 19-21, 2013},
Organization = {Inner Mongolia Univ; Chinese Acad Sci, Res Ctr Eco Environm Sci, Key Lab
   Environm Biotechnol},
Abstract = {In reference to international regional sewage pipe network and sewage
   treatment plant planning, the actual situation of China's villages and
   small town was investigated. According to the costs data from presented
   sewage pipe and sewage treatment plant construction system, the model on
   the sewage pipe network and sewage treatment plant charge was obtained.
   Then the model was simplified to be calculating the shortest distance
   between the wastewater treatment plant and the effluent discharge point.
   The suitable computing method for the shortest distance is building the
   minimum spanning tree. The software for computing was written with prim
   algorithm. The computing results can be used as a planning and design
   reference of sewage pipe network. The model method can be used for
   design program to select long-distance transmission or local treatment
   of the sewage.},
