Organization = {Assoc Res Ctr Urban Underground Space; Sch Mining \& Metallurg Engn;
   Attiko Metro; S \& B; J \& P; OEMEAH; Planet Earth; MYTILINEOS Holdings},
Abstract = {The Osaka City Government started modern sewage works projects in 1894,
   and the city's sewer system now covers nearly 100\% of its population.
   Nevertheless, in our efforts to ensure that future projects progress
   smoothly, we are now facing the greatest challenge of reconfiguring the
   sewage works facilities.
   As we try to reconfigure aged sewage works facilities, we need to make
   even more efficient and multi-purpose use of underground spaces in order
   to promote sewage works projects and to reduce project costs.
   We are now drawing up a sewer reconfiguration plan addressing such many
   challenges as flood control, combined sewer system improvement,
   earthquake countermeasures and the rebuilding and renewing of aged
   sewers. This paper explains the efficient and multi-purpose use of
   underground spaces in order to promote reconfiguring of sewer lines.},
