Abstract = {Following a discussion of the contaminating properties of sewage and an
   international overview of groundwater contamination from leaking sewers,
   the paper focuses on the situation in Britain and Ireland. Evidence of
   sewer-related groundwater contamination in Britain is considered on the
   basis of reported incidents and indirect evidence from groundwater
   quality data. Experience of groundwater contamination from sewers in
   Ireland is then reviewed, including a description of two major incidents
   affecting public water supply sources. Finally, the paper considers the
