Abstract = {At present, corporate social responsibility becomes an important issue.
   Through mathematical model analysis on corporate reputation and
   corporate social responsibility, this paper proposes that corporations
   can achieve profit maximization only if they fulfill their social
   responsibilities and enhance corporate images in setting up a
   responsible reputation. In accordance with the reality of Chinese
   enterprises, the paper also presents four aspects to promote corporate
   reputation: (1) improving consciousness of corporate social
   responsibility; (2) meeting customers' requirements in creating
   long-term benefits; (3) fulfilling social responsibility through social
   commonweal activities; (4) Taking social responsibility based on its
