   European Commiss Hong Kong \& Macao; CSR Asia},
Abstract = {Social responsibility and business ethic construction has been paid much
   attention and regarded as basic management factors of Chinese tourism
   enterprises in recent years. Business ethic of tourism enterprises means
   the business moral criterion of tourism enterprises. It contains ethic
   theories, ethic sense, tradition and practices. Responsibility of
   tourism enterprises includes not only economic responsibility, legal
   responsibility, but also moral and social responsibility. Business ethic
   construction is necessary because it concerns the success of economic
   transition in the Chinese tourism industry and affects the continuous
   development of the tourism industry. This paper discusses the necessity
   of business ethic construction in tourism enterprises, analyses and
   summarizes the business ethic problems based on investigation of tourism
   business ethic, and then puts forward managing strategies on business
   ethic construction in Chinese tourism industry.},
