Abstract = {Since the last two decades, the Chinese Conference \& Exhibition (C\&E)
   industry develops very fast. With the characteristics of high profits
   and low environmental pollution, the industry has shown a large
   potential to become one of the back-bone industries in China. This
   implies that sustainable development of the C\&E industry plays a very
   important role for the Chinese economic and social development. In this
   article, the author firstly discusses the origination and historical
   development of the C\&E industry, then analyses the current status of
   the industry. At the end she provides several strategies for the
   sustainable development of the industry.},
