Abstract = {This paper begins with an overview of relative literature on ethics in
   corporate governance, followed by a touch on what corporate governance
   ethics is and what is to be concluded in corporate governance ethics. It
   then illustrates how corporate governance ethics works with a path
   figure. We conclude that corporate governance ethics affects corporate
   performance in two ways: (1) through the external pressure mechanism
