   generally lack of CSR which shows negative impacts on their competitive
   advantages in terms of social image. This paper analyzes Status quo and
   development of CSR in China, provides reviews on theoretical and
   empirical CSR research, clarifies CSR boundary, defines governance
   Choices for CSR, and analyzes CSR performance and its effect on
