   17, 2006},
Organization = {TU Bergakademie Freiberg; Hong Kong Univ, Ctr Urban Planning \& Environm
   Management; German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; German Ind \& Commerce; Off
   European Commiss Hong Kong \& Macao; CSR Asia},
Abstract = {In the era of knowledge economy, enterprises have to put more attention
   on knowledge management, which can improve their competitiveness. Study
   on the principles of knowledge generation can help enterprises make
   appropriate knowledge management strategy. The improvement of business
   competitiveness includes the improvement of business assets value, the
   improvement of business innovative ability and the growth of business
   profits. Based on knowledge generation, study on the mechanism of
   business intellectual capital growth is an important research direction.
   The organizational intellectual capital growth model stresses that
   enterprises can convert the individual intellectual capital and the team
   intellectual capital into the organizational intellectual capital while
   achieve business intellectual capital growth through the organizational
   learning mechanisms. Meanwhile, the individual intellectual capital and
   team intellectual capital grow simultaneously with the organizational
   intellectual capital.},
